summary:
  A person's press keeps the stamps of the order it replaces.

history:
  A click after waking, with last night's order still standing, was judged
  lapsed at its first hiccup.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              if (userInitiated !== false) _orderDated();

replace:
              if (false) _orderDated();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_person_giving_the_order_dates_it_afresh.
  Line-neutral.
